        { "id": "a", "text": "0, 1, 2, 3" },
        { "id": "b", "text": "-1, 0, 1, 2, 3" },
        { "id": "c", "text": "0, 1, 2, 3, 4" },
        { "id": "d", "text": "1, 2, 3" }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "a",
      "explanation": "Add 1: -1 <= 3n < 12. Divide by 3: -1/3 <= n < 4. The integers satisfying this are 0, 1, 2, 3."
